;----------------------------------
; Weld task buffer
;----------------------------------
; pc2kuka.src latches the task here and sps.sub reads the welder request
; fields. The buffer is global because the local subprograms of pc2kuka.src
; cannot see its local variables and because sps.sub is another interpreter.
